  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (6): Hoth: Main Power Generators (1st Marker), Hoth: North Ridge (4th Marker), Heading For The Medical Frigate, Insurrection, Staging Areas, Squadron Assignments; these count toward the 60. No objective (Echo Base Operations Effect deck); three Effects start and none is named as the starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "X-wing Laser Cannon is listed once, but the author's update at the top of the strategy says 'There are supposed to be 2 X-Wing Laser Cannons' and the section header reads Weapons/Devices (3), so it is counted as 2; the deck then totals 60.",
  "Posted 'Hoth' and 'Endor' dested the Light system cards Hoth (Light) and Endor (Light); 'Boussh' dested Boushh; 'Mirax Terrick' dested Mirax Terrik; 'Millenium Falcon' dested Millennium Falcon.",
  "Posted 'Mon Mothma (read strategy)', 'General Crix Madine (read strategy)', 'Corporal Beezer (read strategy)', 'Portable Scanner (read strategy)' and 'Strike Planning (once again, strategy)' dested the plain Endor/Hoth cards; the parentheses are the author's pointers to the strategy text.",
  "Posted 'Obi-Wan Kenobi' dested the Premiere Obi-Wan Kenobi (the strategy says 'Obi-Wan (not EPP)').",
